OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 20 MAR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker showcases the
OL,6,     Gconcert performances from the UK
OL,7,     G& beyond, with Richard Strauss's
OL,8,     GEin Heldenleben and highlights
OL,9,     Gfrom the orchestral suite of
OL,10,     GWagner's Gotterdammerung.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Donizetti
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod follows the
OL,13,     Girresistible rise of Italian
OL,14,     Gopera composer Gaetano Donizetti.
OL,15,     GToday, he tells the story of
OL,16,     GDonizetti's prolific and dramatic
OL,17,     Glate years.
