OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 20 MAR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland Rocks
OL,5,     GScotland has been blessed with
OL,6,     Gthe most exciting of gemstones,
OL,7,     Gbut knowing where to find them is
OL,8,     Gthe secret. Kenneth Steven
OL,9,     Gcombines Scottish geological
OL,10,     Ghistory with his poetry.
OL,11,G2200FLate Junction
OL,12,     GThe vernal equinox is upon us!
OL,13,     GJennifer Lucy Allan shares
OL,14,     Gsurprising sounds and fresh cuts
OL,15,     Gto celebrate the new season.
OL,16,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,17,     GTonight, Soweto has concert
OL,18,     Ghighlights from Sligo pianist
OL,19,     GNils Kavanagh and his trio,
OL,20,     Grecorded live at JPN late last
OL,21,     Gyear.
